<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Jefferies cut Aquila Gas.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Jefferies cut Aquila Gas.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jefferies downgraded Aquila Gas to hold from buy, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Aquila lost 1-1/16 to 11-1/2.</p>
